        `,-1)])]),_:1})),t[10]||(t[10]=l('<p>只有双向发现都完成（双方都建立了对方实体的代理）并且匹配检查通过，数据通道才真正激活。「看得见」与「能通信」是两个不同的门槛，代理模型把两者拆开了。</p> <h2 id="匹配流程" tabindex="-1">匹配流程 <a class="header-anchor" href="#匹配流程" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;匹配流程&quot;">​</a></h2> <p>代理的创建遵循严格的层级逻辑：</p> <ol><li><strong>参与者发现</strong>：收到远程节点的 SPDP 消息，创建 Proxy Participant，并启动租约计时。</li> <li><strong>端点发现</strong>：收到 SEDP 消息，在对应 Proxy Participant 下创建 Proxy Writer 或 Proxy Reader。</li> <li><strong>匹配检查</strong>：检查本地端点与代理是否满足匹配条件——主题名称、类型名称、QoS 设置三者都要一致。匹配失败的代理只是存在，不产生通信。</li></ol> ',8)),(E(),A(i,null,{default:e(()=>[B(r,{id:"mermaid-103",class:"mermaid",graph:"flowchart%20TD%0A%20%20%20%20A%5B%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9B%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%BF%5D%20--%3E%20B%5B%E5%B9%BF%E6%92%AD%20SPDP%20%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF%5D%0A%20%20%20%20B%20--%3E%20C%5B%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9A%E6%94%B6%E5%88%B0%20SPDP%3Cbr%2F%3E%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%20Proxy%20Participant%5D%0A%20%20%20%20C%20--%3E%20D%5B%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9B%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%20SEDP%20%E5%AE%A3%E5%91%8A%E7%AB%AF%E7%82%B9%5D%0A%20%20%20%20D%20--%3E%20E%5B%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9A%E6%94%B6%E5%88%B0%20SEDP%3Cbr%2F%3E%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%20Proxy%20Writer%2FReader%5D%0A%20%20%20%20E%20--%3E%20F%7B%E5%8C%B9%E9%85%8D%E6%A3%80%E6%9F%A5%3Cbr%2F%3ETopic%20%2B%20Type%20%2B%20QoS%7D%0A%20%20%20%20F%20--%20%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%20--%3E%20G%5B%E5%BB%BA%E7%AB%8B%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%E8%BF%9E%E6%8E%A5%3Cbr%2F%3E%E5%85%81%E8%AE%B8%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E6%B5%81%E5%8A%A8%5D%0A%20%20%20%20F%20--%20%E4%B8%8D%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%20--%3E%20H%5B%E4%B8%8D%E5%BB%BA%E7%AB%8B%E8%BF%9E%E6%8E%A5%3Cbr%2F%3E%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E4%BD%86%E4%B8%8D%E9%80%9A%E4%BF%A1%5D%0A"})]),fallback:e(()=>[...t[4]||(t[4]=[a(`
